      "id": "reading-031-s002",
      "english": "There is no friend so good as a good conscience.",
      "korean": "좋은 양심만큼 좋은 친구는 없다."
    },
    {
      "id": "reading-031-s003",
      "english": "There is no enemy so dangerous as a bad conscience.",
